Product Engineer &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-top.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re bold thinkers and kind teammates, growing fast but staying grounded. Our Nordic roots and global outlook shape a culture of friendliness, creativity, and collaboration, all powered by openness and shared wins. We care deeply about doing the right thing – and doing it together. We aim to improve the flow of goods, time, and energy – and we know we can&#39;t shape the future by clinging to the past. So, we keep evolving, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;RELEX Solutions delivers a unified supply chain planning platform for retailers and manufacturers, enabled by proven AI technology. We help companies optimize demand forecasting, replenishment, merchandising, pricing and promotions, supply chain operations, and production planning across the end-to-end value chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a global team of over 2,000 professionals, we work side-by-side with our customers to solve real problems with lasting impact. Companies trust RELEX to increase product availability, boost sales, deliver actionable insights, improve sustainability, and drive profitable growth. Join us and make an impact on the world and your career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In response to our fast growth and market expansion, we&#39;re looking for experienced Product Engineers to join our Supply Chain product teams: people who thrive at the intersection of customer problems, technical solutions, and business strategy, and who want to own outcomes from discovery through production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we need you to do and be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bring your ideas. Challenge ours. Grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own requirements end-to-end for your product area, from discovery through UAT and quality assurance, making sure what ships solves the real underlying problem, not just the stated ask.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your deployed product and iterate fast: manage releases, gather structured customer feedback, and feed it back into the next iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your Engineering Manager to translate customer needs and usage data into team-level priorities, keeping the roadmap grounded in real outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an industry and product expert in customer-facing settings, pushing back on stated requirements when the evidence points elsewhere, and supporting sales efforts such as scoping and feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate that solutions genuinely meet customer expectations through ongoing quality gates and proactive expectation management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our five values are our playbook. We speak up when things don&#39;t make sense. We stop doing what doesn&#39;t add value. We stay curious, back each other up, and make space for both innovation and laughter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of your customers&#39; day-to-day work, goals, and pain points across an entire product area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence to push back on stated customer needs when evidence points to a different solution, and experience mentoring other Product Engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing solutions to complex problems spanning data, AI/ML, UX, and system integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid software engineering and DevOps skills, building and deploying solutions using RELEX&#39;s existing frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with using AI in your everyday work and developing the use of AI tools as a larger organizational strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a bonus, we consider experience working with an international team, plus great communication and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer in return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll be supported and given the space to thrive. We offer meaningful work, flexibility, and a culture that backs you to share your voice and be authentic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international career and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A rapidly growing and financially robust software company with exciting opportunities for career growth, also in the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility in how and where you work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Room to thrive in a fast-growing global company with a good market position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical benefits that support work, family, wellness, and everyday life&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diverse, inclusive, and supportive work culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work that meaningfully reduces waste and improves sustainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership, autonomy and flat hierarchies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two paid volunteering days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real leadership development paths, a genuine range of roles across product areas, continued investment in the team, and hands-on exposure to new technologies including agentic engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this is the opportunity you don&#39;t want to miss, apply by sending your cover letter and resume through the application form as soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that to be considered for this position, you must be based in one of our office locations and hold a valid work permit for your location. We&#39;re excited to connect with applicants who meet these criteria and share our passion to do hard things, trust each other, and build what&#39;s next for the product, the planet, and the people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today and be part of the future. Be RELEX!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-bottom.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Templates

Senior Software Engineer &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Sony Music Entertainment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sony Music Entertainment, we fuel the creative journey. We’ve played a pioneering role in music history, from the first-ever music label to the invention of the flat disc record. We’ve nurtured some of music’s most iconic artists and produced some of the most influential recordings of all time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we work in more than 70 countries, supporting a diverse roster of international superstars, developing and independent artists, and visionary creators. From our position at the intersection of music, entertainment, and technology, we bring imagination and expertise to the newest products and platforms, embrace new business models, employ breakthrough tools, and provide powerful insights that help our artists push creative boundaries and reach new audiences. In everything we do, we&#39;re committed to artistic integrity, transparency, and entrepreneurship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music Entertainment is a member of the Sony family of global companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music’s Product, Design, Engineering and Global Operations (PDEGO) organization is looking for a Senior Software Engineer to join our growing engineering team in our London office. You’ll help build and evolve the platforms that power some of the most critical areas of our global business and support artists, songwriters, labels, and partners around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to solve complex engineering challenges at scale while working closely with product managers, business stakeholders, and cross-functional partners to modernize the systems that support the music industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and enhance scalable applications that support Sony Music’s global products and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain high-quality software across the full application stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers and business stakeholders to translate complex business requirements into reliable technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable, and well-tested code with a focus on long-term quality and system reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in architecture discussions, technical design, and modernization initiatives across our platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design APIs and services that integrate with internal systems and third-party platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help improve application performance, observability, scalability, and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior engineers through code reviews, technical guidance, and knowledge sharing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering leadership to establish engineering best practices and continuously improve development processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot production issues using logs, monitoring, and root-cause analysis to ensure platform stability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional software engineering experience building and maintaining complex software applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing distributed systems and service-oriented architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Python and JavaScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building frontend applications using TypeScript and React&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with databases and query technologies such as MySQL, Snowflake, Neo4j, Kafka, OpenSearch, or similar platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and consuming RESTful APIs and working with HTTP and OAuth standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working within AWS cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing unit, integration, and automated tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience investigating production issues through logging, monitoring, and performance analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Agile development environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to collaborate across engineering, product, and business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in learning the complexities of the systems and business processes that support the global music industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ideal candidate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building software for financial, accounting, ERP, payments, e-commerce, content, data, or other highly complex and data-intensive business systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience modeling complex business domains and translating business rules into scalable software solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data modeling, schema design, and relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience optimizing application performance, database queries, and large-scale data processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for improving engineering standards, developer tooling, and technical documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to mentor engineers and lead technical initiatives without direct people-management responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, collaborative, and proactive, with a continuous-improvement mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in music, technology, and building systems that directly support artists and creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You join a vibrant global community with the opportunity to channel your passion every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A modern office environment designed for you, empowering you to bring your best&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Hybrid work environment: Our London office is designed for collaboration, offering a balanced hybrid setup (3 days in office / 2 days remote)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
